stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received
    received --> processing: job picked
    processing --> awaiting_analyst: escalation (interrupt)
    processing --> awaiting_client: info requested (interrupt)
    awaiting_analyst --> processing: analyst decision
    awaiting_client --> processing: client reply
    awaiting_client --> expired: timeout
    processing --> approved
    processing --> approved_edd
    processing --> rejected
    processing --> failed: unrecoverable error (fail closed)
    failed --> awaiting_analyst: dead-letter review
    approved --> [*]
    approved_edd --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
